 Bagel","address":"4716 Freret St","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70115","stars":4.0,"review_count":193,"categories":["Food","Bagels"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"8rpTqJOgmOCqLN5OCxaVOw","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":299,"mm_rank":296,"target_category_support_fraction":0.5,"selected_image_count":5,"label_diversity":3,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Bagels","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8rpTqJOgmOCqLN5OCxaVOw","review_id":"C_3DCmYMm7wyUjF01AMZnA","date":"2018-07-23T03:16:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9482790231704712,"text_excerpt":"New Yorker here! As it's been said before, this city is pretty limited in their bagel options so when Humble Bagel opened, I was curious to see if it would live up to my expectations. For those of you who haven't had the privilege (I know, I know) of having a fresh Long Island bagel, y'all are missing out. But I digress... back to Humble. It's good! I can honestly say I was surprised by how good these bagels were. They aren't exactly the same as NY bagels but they are the best in the city and a wonderful replacement for when that carby-craving hits. My favorite is their whole-wheat everything with veggie cream cheese (they have good cream cheese too!! Which is harder to find than you thin..."},{"business_id":"8rpTqJOgmOCqLN5OCxaVOw","review_id":"90i4YAH2n_r3yTpOIWPRfg","date":"2018-03-26T15:05:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9444295167922974,"text_excerpt":"Being from NY, bagels have been a staple in my life for as long as I can remember. There was nothing like waking up on a Sunday morning to a giant bag of two dozen bagels for my family and containers of different flavor cream cheese. So when I moved to NOLA last year, I was obviously bummed that bagels here are basically nonexistent, but one day a friend recommended I try Humble Bagel. I finally got around to trying it yesterday, and I was quite satisfied! I got an everything bagel with egg whites and cheddar and my fiancé got an everything bagel with cream cheese. He didn't like that his bagel had way more poppy seeds on his than mine did, but I personally didn't care. Aside from that, I..."},{"business_id":"8rpTqJOgmOCqLN5OCxaVOw","review_id":"N8hq0t5qGGv_HZsO1m-jfQ","date":"2014-05-14T14:43:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9441981315612793,"text_excerpt":"When Artz Bagels closed, they left a bagel-shaped hole in my heart. I live in the West Bank, but I'll drive pretty darn far out of my way to get a good bagel on Saturday morning. I was really excited when I heard Humble Bagel was opening up to (hopefully) fill that bagel void. I've been a few times now and I've always been pleased with my bagel. One good thing to note about their bagels is the size. They're huge! The texture is good, if not quite as hard on the outside as some. Right now they offer your standard bagel options-- plain, whole wheat, everything, etc., and a fairly limited selection of cream cheeses. The veggie is my recommendation-- lots of good flavor. I had the special cre..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8rpTqJOgmOCqLN5OCxaVOw","photo_id":"F09xriFqio0Kl0ysf-wRPg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/F09xriFqio0Kl0ysf-wRPg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9177960157394409},{"business_id":"8rpTqJOgmOCqLN5OCxaVOw","photo_id":"Nke3OaB7-qC8iUbqjjI1mA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Nke3OaB7-qC8iUbqjjI1mA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.861324667930603},{"business_id":"8rpTqJOgmOCqLN5OCxaVOw","photo_id":"by2VAOIf_n1rnB6-CwUx0g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/by2VAOIf_n1rnB6-CwUx0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8306326866149902},{"business_id":"8rpTqJOgmOCqLN5OCxaVOw","photo_id":"xHSO5ukF3e350lvQO3ItRA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/xHSO5ukF3e350lvQO3ItRA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7817716002464294},{"business_id":"8rpTqJOgmOCqLN5OCxaVOw","photo_id":"PzxnrY2kTvQLi8wqw2U4wQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/PzxnrY2kTvQLi8wqw2U4wQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7817603349685669}]},"notebook_case":null}
